WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.688 --> 00:00:20.499
Chuck: It's coming right for Dave: I've I've never been so scared in my life.

2
00:00:21.199 --> 00:00:23.501
Chuck: I'm too scared to move!

3
00:00:23.521 --> 00:00:25.242
Dave: Me too.

4
00:00:26.122 --> 00:00:28.844
It's like my feet are stuck to the ground.

5
00:00:33.652 --> 00:00:34.933
Chuck: I don't know what to do!

6
00:00:34.953 --> 00:00:36.714
Dave: Hold me!

7
00:00:37.535 --> 00:00:38.016
Chuck: Okay.

8
00:00:38.176 --> 00:00:41.819
Dave: I'm going to miss you, Chuck!

9
00:00:41.879 --> 00:00:44.801
Chuck: I'm going to miss you, Dave!

10
00:00:44.821 --> 00:00:48.204
Chuck Dave: You're my best friend in the world!

11
00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:55.970
Chuck Dave: Aaah!

12
00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.772
Chuck: It it went down a hole!

13
00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:00.113
Dave: We're okay!

14
00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:02.955
Chuck: It's not going to hurt us!

15
00:01:04.236 --> 00:01:05.577
Chuck Dave: Yaaay!

16
00:01:06.237 --> 00:01:12.521
Chuck: Did you just hug me?

17
00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:14.262
Dave: No way!

18
00:01:14.282 --> 00:01:17.643
Chuck: You were crying like a baby!

19
00:01:17.663 --> 00:01:19.444
Dave: I was not!

20
00:01:20.025 --> 00:01:21.125
You were the baby!

21
00:01:28.309 --> 00:01:30.410
You were scared like a little girl!

22
00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:33.112
Dave: You were too scared to move!

23
00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:36.293
Chuck: Wait a minute.

24
00:01:36.773 --> 00:01:40.036
Stop. Let's calm down.

25
00:01:40.056 --> 00:01:43.819
Dave: I'm calm.

26
00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:46.081
And I'm not scared.

27
00:01:46.101 --> 00:01:47.362
Chuck: Good.

28
00:01:47.822 --> 00:01:49.424
Now, let's make a promise.

29
00:01:49.444 --> 00:01:50.765
Dave: What?

30
00:01:50.785 --> 00:01:55.729
Chuck: Promise that we will never, ever mention what just happened.

31
00:01:55.749 --> 00:01:57.711
Dave: I agree.

32
00:01:58.632 --> 00:02:00.833
No one must know how scared we were.

33
00:02:00.853 --> 00:02:03.676
Chuck: We'll pretend that it never happened.

34
00:02:04.588 --> 00:02:05.689
Dave: What never happened?

35
00:02:05.709 --> 00:02:07.129
Chuck: Exactly.

36
00:02:07.509 --> 00:02:08.730
It's forgotten already.

37
00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:13.432
Dave: I wonder what kind of monster that was.

38
00:02:13.452 --> 00:02:16.113
Chuck: It looked like a regular worm.

39
00:02:16.173 --> 00:02:18.013
Dave: You're right.

40
00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:21.515
Chuck: But that worm was big enough to squash us!

41
00:02:21.535 --> 00:02:25.937
Dave: This sure is a strange land.

42
00:02:25.957 --> 00:02:28.758
Chuck: Maybe we aren't in a strange land.

43
00:02:28.778 --> 00:02:34.100
Chuck: I think we are still in the playground, but now we are super tiny.

44
00:02:38.988 --> 00:02:41.810
Dave: Do you mean that Danny and Brad really did shrink us?

45
00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:43.331
Chuck: Yes.

46
00:02:43.832 --> 00:02:50.136
Everything around us is normal, except that you and [n3@I are the smallest things in the world.

47
00:02:50.156 --> 00:02:52.157
Dave: Oh man.

48
00:02:52.518 --> 00:02:55.760
I'll make sure Danny and Brad suffer for doing this to us!

49
00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:58.662
Chuck: So what do we do now?

50
00:02:58.702 --> 00:03:01.024
Dave: Help!

51
00:03:01.064 --> 00:03:02.405
Help! Help!

52
00:03:02.985 --> 00:03:07.048
Chuck: No one is going to hear you, Dave.

53
00:03:07.068 --> 00:03:09.345
Dave: Oh no.

54
00:03:09.827 --> 00:03:10.652
You're wrong.

55
00:03:11.476 --> 00:03:12.882
Someone did hear me.
